            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishboshethini, ilmi Saulo, ijeecha Abineri ka Hebroniti ijeesani d'agaye jennaani sodaate, lubbuuni d'ufte worri Israeli ch'ufti guddo rifate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishboshethini nama lama qaba, ka Askarti isaa iti mata. Toko maqaani isaa Baana, kaani Rekabu worri lachu ilmaani Rimoni, ka worri isaa Birothi lafa worra gosa Benjamini keesa (Birothini sunileeni lafuma Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami duri lafa Birothi tau lafa Githaimuti baqate haga arrale achuma taa.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
